# ── SD Masters — TEACHERS repo .gitignore ──────────────────────────────────
# This shared repo tracks ONLY teacher content:
#   README.md, CLAUDE.md, this .gitignore, each master's CLAUDE.md + CURRICULUM.md,
#   and the Interviewer's CLAUDE.md + RUBRICS.md + COMPANIES.md.
# EVERYTHING else under a master folder is a LEARNER'S personal workspace
# (their progress ledger, notes, and code). That lives in the learner's OWN
# git repo and must NEVER enter this shared teachers repo.

# Ignore everything inside each master folder...
HLD-Master/*
LLD-Master/*
DSA-Master/*
AIEngineer-Master/*
Interviewer/*
# ...then re-include only the teacher content.
!HLD-Master/CLAUDE.md
!HLD-Master/CURRICULUM.md
!LLD-Master/CLAUDE.md
!LLD-Master/CURRICULUM.md
!DSA-Master/CLAUDE.md
!DSA-Master/CURRICULUM.md
!AIEngineer-Master/CLAUDE.md
!AIEngineer-Master/CURRICULUM.md
!Interviewer/CLAUDE.md
!Interviewer/RUBRICS.md
!Interviewer/COMPANIES.md

# Safety nets, in case a learner keeps work at other paths:
**/workspace/
**/target/
**/.idea/
*.class
